_minted*/
*.pyg
*.figlist
*.makefile
*.fls

# The compiled book PDF: ignore by default. If you DO want to commit the final
# PDF as a deliverable, remove the next line or force-add it deliberately.
# billiard_ball_universe.pdf
# AI-generated illustration masters live in art/ and ARE committed (they are
# sources, not build artifacts) -- do not add art/ here.
#
# One exception: art/cover/ is the SUPERSEDED cover working directory from before the
# REPO-2 restructure, not a master. The live cover is cover/, and art/cover/'s copies are
# stale -- its cover_wrap.tex still carries the retired "local ratio", its
# cover_art_build.tex predates both the SPDX headers and the zoomcone refactor (4d7f7be),
# and its PROVENANCE.md lacks the regeneration section. Committing it would duplicate the
# cover and write the retired phrase into public history. Kept on disk (and on the
# external mirror) as generation history -- candidate rounds, contact sheets, the
# gen_candidates scripts -- which its own nested .gitignore was already curating.
art/cover/

# ---- Environment / secrets ----
# If any tooling talks to an LLM endpoint, keys live here — never commit them.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

# ---- Editors / IDEs ----
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~

